      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/8/682ca7aefb9d0027c44c59f5a40209cb94939b2e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/682ca7aefb9d0027c44c59f5a40209cb94939b2e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/8/682ca7aefb9d0027c44c59f5a40209cb94939b2e_2_690x288.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"eRzkrX53OVRvaXOq5d78Ay97UKi\" width=\"690\" height=\"288\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/8/682ca7aefb9d0027c44c59f5a40209cb94939b2e_2_690x288.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/8/682ca7aefb9d0027c44c59f5a40209cb94939b2e_2_1035x432.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/8/682ca7aefb9d0027c44c59f5a40209cb94939b2e.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1D1C1B\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1050×439 27 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>In the image above is an example of the problem with rounding decimals. Especially in sales taxes and charges, it always has a rounding decimal added to the total.</p>\n<p>Due to having conflict with decimals, how am I able to disable the rounding off total and also to prevent from generating rounding off account?</p>",
