      "created_at": "2025-09-02T06:27:20.097Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Check Disable Rounded Total checkbox in Global Defaults</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/0/e07722776541b7c1e453a442a21fdccac9aa6841.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e07722776541b7c1e453a442a21fdccac9aa6841\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e07722776541b7c1e453a442a21fdccac9aa6841_2_690x255.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"w1IchItiMUt9lcR738fsyhIsVJT\" width=\"690\" height=\"255\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e07722776541b7c1e453a442a21fdccac9aa6841_2_690x255.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e07722776541b7c1e453a442a21fdccac9aa6841_2_1035x382.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e07722776541b7c1e453a442a21fdccac9aa6841_2_1380x510.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2468×914 158 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\nAlso in your currency change Smallest Currency Fraction Value to 0.01 or 0.001</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/d/0d8e40863bee6ca342d82430a97f4f2c98965d0f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0d8e40863bee6ca342d82430a97f4f2c98965d0f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/d/0d8e40863bee6ca342d82430a97f4f2c98965d0f_2_690x421.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"1VUYNTTCoaLk3lAo4MbUzmeeOsf\" width=\"690\" height=\"421\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/d/0d8e40863bee6ca342d82430a97f4f2c98965d0f_2_690x421.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/d/0d8e40863bee6ca342d82430a97f4f2c98965d0f_2_1035x631.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/d/0d8e40863bee6ca342d82430a97f4f2c98965d0f_2_1380x842.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1590×972 63 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
